        ';   [KOPF] .. [LOG]  = HTML. Entities and markup like <b> are allowed - these',
        ';                      texts go into the page unfiltered.',
        ';   [PRUEF]          = plain text of the test output. It is escaped by wi_e(),',
        ';                      so an entity would show up literally. No markup there.',
